OL,3,GNEWSADanske bank to move 250 staff to
OL,4,ABelfast city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FDanske Bank is to move its Northern
OL,7,FIreland call centre staff into its
OL,8,FBelfast city centre headquarters.
OL,10,FThe call centre currently employs about
OL,11,F250 people at an office block in
OL,12,FDunmurry, a south Belfast suburb.
OL,14,FThe bank is planning a
OL,15,F"multi-million-pounds refurbishment"
OL,16,Fbefore the move which is planned for
OL,17,Fthe end of next year.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
