OL,3,GNEWSADanske bank to move 250 staff to
OL,4,ABelfast city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FDanske Bank UK chief executive
OL,7,FJulie-Ann Haines said: "Creating a
OL,8,Fshared home in the city centre will
OL,9,Fhelp strengthen collaboration, teamwork
OL,10,Fand a one bank culture."
